      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1781782936911,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n    Role Mapping (Server-side):\n    \n    dBildungscloud Role -> BBB Role\n    --------------------------------\n    Teacher / RoomAdmin / BoardAdmin               -> MODERATOR\n      \n    Student / RoomViewer / BoardReader/Editor -> VIEWER\n      \n    ExternalPerson / TeamExpert                           -> VIEWER + guest=true\n      \n    Guests blocked if waitingRoom disabled",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "note-roles",
      "originalText": "\n    Role Mapping (Server-side):\n    \n    dBildungscloud Role -> BBB Role\n    --------------------------------\n    Teacher / RoomAdmin / BoardAdmin               -> MODERATOR\n      \n    Student / RoomViewer / BoardReader/Editor -> VIEWER\n      \n    ExternalPerson / TeamExpert                           -> VIEWER + guest=true\n      \n    Guests blocked if waitingRoom disabled",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "index": "aa"
    },
